-- =====================================================================
-- Demo: AUCC 2027, the 15th Asia Undergraduate Conference on Computing
-- (การประชุมวิชาการระดับปริญญาตรีด้านคอมพิวเตอร์ภูมิภาคเอเชีย ครั้งที่ 15), from
-- its real poster. Wed 3 – Fri 5 Feb 2570 (2027) at คณะวิทยาการจัดการและ
-- เทคโนโลยีสารสนเทศ มหาวิทยาลัยนครพนม.
--
-- It is another university's conference, so here it is the department's
-- trip to it: students sign up to present or attend, the department covers
-- them from Student Academic Empowerment (แผนพัฒนานักศึกษา ภาควิชาคอมพิวเตอร์
-- ปีงบประมาณ 2569, item 4, ผศ.โอภาส — the plan doesn't split that sum, so this
-- trip is given a share), so there is nothing to pay here; the conference's
-- own fees are listed in the description. Sign-up runs 15 Oct – 25 Dec 2569,
-- the conference's paper call to its normal registration deadline, so it is
-- open today; a few students have signed up. The poster gives no daily
-- times, so 08.30–16.30 is assumed.
--
-- The poster is 1092 x 1498; posters here must be 1:1, 3:4 or 9:16, so it is
-- padded to 3:4 (1124 x 1498) by repeating its left and right columns.
--
-- Apply AFTER schema, seed, demo_organizer, seed_blacklist. Safe to run
-- again: it removes event 1063 (registrations cascade) first.
--   docker exec -i cpsu-etms-mysql mysql --default-character-set=utf8mb4 -uroot cpsu_etms < database/seed_aucc2027.sql
-- =====================================================================

USE cpsu_etms;
SET NAMES utf8mb4;

DELETE FROM events WHERE id = 1063;

INSERT INTO events (id, title, description, category, subcategory, program, years, organizer_id, organizer_name, coordinator_id,
